2186109950 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "68cb3d0c-c21e-5cb1-b41c-016834544214" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110494 #edb/ref 1069 "e-4067" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110494 #edb/ref 1071 "Find the exact solution of the equation $2^{x+1}=3.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110494 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "7c937587-dc81-5ee9-aa66-a509a87433e2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110494 #edb/ref 1074 "First, we take $\\log_2$ of both sides of the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{2}^{x+1} & =3 \\\\ {log}_{2}⁡({2}^{x+1}) & ={log}_{2}⁡(3)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we use the fact that $\\log_b \\left( b^c \\right) = c$ to simplify the left-hand side. This gives\n\n$$\nx+1 = \\log_2 \\left( 3 \\right).\n$$\n\nFinally, we solve for $x,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x+1 & ={log}_{2}⁡(3) \\\\ x & ={log}_{2}⁡(3)-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $x= \\log_2 \\left( 3 \\right) - 1.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110593 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186048725 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110593 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186111048 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110593 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186111370 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110593 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186544786 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110593 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186544814 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110593 #edb/ref 1039 "Finding Exact Solutions to Exponential Equations Using Logarithms" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110593 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186110494 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186110593 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "34f4b65e-b93a-51e8-b943-b3b53d47fffb" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111048 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186108045 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111048 #edb/ref 1069 "q-25124" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111048 #edb/ref 1071 "Find the exact solution of the equation $3^{x - 2} = 6$." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111048 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "f2ec7bb2-2b5c-5a6c-af77-21a3068576a7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [1759218611137